Fix namespace case of the AI Agents CKEditor plugin so it matches its directory.

The class lives in src/Plugin/AiCKEditor/ but declares the namespace
Drupal\ai_agents\Plugin\AICKEditor. Plugin discovery derives the class name
from the directory, so on case-sensitive filesystems with the Symfony
DebugClassLoader active this throws "Case mismatch between loaded and
declared class names" on every text-format render after a cache rebuild.

--- a/src/Plugin/AiCKEditor/AiAgentsCKEditor.php
+++ b/src/Plugin/AiCKEditor/AiAgentsCKEditor.php
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 <?php
 
-namespace Drupal\ai_agents\Plugin\AICKEditor;
+namespace Drupal\ai_agents\Plugin\AiCKEditor;
 
 declare(strict_types=1);
 
